      "content": "I'm sorry, what? I don't understand. What do you mean by \"goblins\" sabotaging the shipments? I need a professional logistics checklist, please. Can you just focus on the actual contingency protocols for temperature excursions and the regulatory documentation needed for Southeast Asian customs?",
